
# <type>(<scope>): <summary, <=72 chars, English preferred>
#   type : feat fix refactor perf test docs chore build exp data revert
#   scope: config data splits features models evaluation tracking pipelines viz cli
#          configs rules records env repo
#
# Body: why, what changed, how it was verified (command + result).
#
# Required trailers (checked by .githooks/commit-msg):
# Task: T-YYYYMMDD-NN            (or "Task: trivial" for typo-level fixes)
# Actor: cursor/<model> | claude-code/<model> | grokbot+claude-code/<model> | human/<name>
# Optional: Co-authored-by: ...
# Rules: docs/standards/git-workflow.md
